From: kaiwater <kaiwater@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: extend RX calibration to the PON PCS

The AN7581 PCS driver only enables manual RX calibration and the CDR
recovery callback for the Ethernet PCS instance
("airoha,an7581-pcs-eth").  XR1710G routes its 10G WAN (GDM2) through
the PON PCS instance ("airoha,an7581-pcs-pon") with a USXGMII copper
link, so the same sequence is needed there: without it, affected units
complete copper autonegotiation and then stay at NO-CARRIER with no
"Link is Up" and no DHCP, while healthy units only work because their
default SerDes tuning happens to lock.

Enable the existing manual calibration gate and the rxlock workaround
for the PON PCS as well.  Optical PON line-mode calibration is
untouched.

Signed-off-by: kaiwater <kaiwater@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
@@ -1316,11 +1316,13 @@
 	if (IS_ERR(priv->xfi_rst))
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(priv->xfi_rst), "failed to get xfi reset lines\n");
 
-	/* For Ethernet PCS, read the AN7581 SoC revision to check if
-	 * manual rx calibration is needed. Extend the manual-calibration
-	 * threshold to include E2 silicon.
+	/* For the external SerDes PCS instances, read the AN7581 SoC
+	 * revision to check if manual RX calibration is needed. Extend the
+	 * manual-calibration threshold to include E2 silicon and apply the
+	 * same gate to the PON PCS used by the 10G WAN port.
 	 */
-	if (device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-eth")) {
+	if (device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-eth") ||
+	    device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-pon")) {
 		u32 val;
 
 		ret = regmap_read(priv->scu, AIROHA_SCU_PDIDR, &val);
@@ -1388,6 +1390,7 @@
 	.alloc_regmap_fields = an7581_pcs_alloc_regmap_fields,
 	.bringup = an7581_pcs_bringup,
 	.link_up = an7581_pcs_phya_link_up,
+	.rxlock_workaround = an7581_pcs_rxlock_workaround,
 };
 
 static const struct airoha_pcs_match_data an7581_pcs_pcie = {
